    Auden \",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":690.5,\"yPos\":239.000122},\"ID\":8,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"He
    knows that this is insane. This place looks incredibly human. He continues exploring,
